<title>UK: Babcock chief leaves to join GEC-Alsthom.</title>
<headline>Babcock chief leaves to join GEC-Alsthom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Babcock International Group Plc said on Friday that chief executive Nick Salmon will leave the firm at the end of May to join GEC-Alsthom NV as managing director of its power generation division.  </p>
<p>The British engineering group said in a statement that John Parker will temporarily re-assume the role of chief executive (CEO) while the appointment of a new CEO is made.</p>
<p>It also said that finance director Erik Porter will retire at the end of the year and that the process of finding his replacement is already underway.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
